1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:06,846
There were three of us. One weekend. A forest nobody had camped in for years.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,050
We thought it was just a story.

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,747
By nightfall, we had a tent, a fire…

4
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:18,889
and the strange feeling that we weren't alone.

5
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,850
Lena saw it first.

6
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:28,367
Something tall. Between the trees.

7
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,290
It wasn't moving.

8
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,138
I pointed my flashlight at it…

9
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,609
and it was gone.

10
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,659
Max said it was just a tree.

11
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:44,180
Around midnight, I woke up.

12
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:49,355
The fire was out. The forest had gone completely silent.

13
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:59,461
Footsteps. Three slow steps. Right outside the tent.

14
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:06,092
It was closer now. Much closer.

15
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,032
And it was watching our tent.

16
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:12,853
I woke the others.

17
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:18,311
But by the time we got outside… there was no one there.

18
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,166
In the morning, we packed up to leave.

19
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:27,554
But the path we came in on… was gone.

20
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:34,114
Then I saw the words carved into a tree.

21
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:37,756
Do not look back.

22
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:42,515
We'd had no signal for hours.

23
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,834
But my phone buzzed.

24
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:47,872
One new message.

25
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:50,500
I looked up…

26
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,214
It wasn't alone.

